   "title": "Market volatility expanding amid AI uncertainties: financial authorities",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261127/market-volatility-expanding-amid-ai-uncertainties-financial-authorities",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
