   "title": "Korea's speed, Finland's lifelong learning could build human skills in AI age",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/education/20261127/koreas-speed-finlands-lifelong-learning-could-build-human-skills-in-ai-age",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
