   "title": "Song Joong-ki 'still looks like a college student' despite being a father of two",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/20261127/song-joong-ki-still-looks-like-a-college-student-despite-being-a-father-of-two",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:52:03 GMT",
   "_dt": 1795755123.0,
   "ageDays": 0.01,
   "summary": "Actor Song Joong-ki is drawing attention for his remarkably youthful appearance, with a recent firsthand account suggesting that the father of two seems to have barely aged. Song, who serves as an official ambassador for the foundation, attended the event as part of his efforts to raise awareness of Korea's cultural heritage. Despite his youthful appearance, Song has frequently been spotted embracing fatherhood, with several eyewitness accounts of his family outings circulating online.",
   "summary_zh": "演员宋仲基因容貌异常年轻而受到关注，近期一篇第一人称讲述称，这位二孩父亲似乎几乎未显衰老。宋仲基担任某基金会的官方大使，并出席了此次活动，以 efforts 提高人们对韩国文化遗产的认识。尽管看起来年轻，宋仲基却经常被看到享受父亲生活，网上还流传着数个关于他与家人外出的目击记录。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Actor Song Joong-ki is drawing attention for his remarkably youthful appearance, with a recent firsthand account suggesting that the father of two seems to have barely aged. On Wednesday, entrepreneur Choi Sun-jung, the daughter-in-law of veteran actress Sunwoo Eun-sook, shared footage on social media from an event celebrating the 24th anniversary of YÉOL, a foundation dedicated to preserving and promoting Korean cultural heritage. Song, who serves as an official ambassador for the foundation, attended the event as part of his efforts to raise awareness of Korea's cultural heritage. However, it was Choi's description of Song's appearance in person that caught particular attention. When a social media user asked whether she had seen the actor, Choi said, \"Yes. He still looks like a college student. It's as if he's been freeze-dried. He's really handsome.\" Her playful reference to freeze-drying suggested that the actor's youthful looks had been perfectly preserved over the years. In the accompanying video, Song appeared onstage wearing a black knit sweater and tailored trousers. With his neatly styled bangs and understated outfit, the actor showed off his signature boyish charm, making it hard to believe he is already a father of two. He married British former actress Katy Louise Saunders in January 2023, and the couple have a son and a daughter. Despite his youthful appearance, Song has frequently been spotted embracing fatherhood, with several eyewitness accounts of his family outings circulating online. \"He seemed like a young, family-oriented dad,\" one social media user said in a previous account. \"He took care of everything himself, including the stroller and bags.\" This article from Xportsnews was adapted by a generative AI system and edited by The Korea Times",
