   "title": "Seoul stocks up over 2% Friday morning amid AI jitters",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/others/20261127/seoul-stocks-up-over-2-friday-morning-amid-ai-jitters",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
