   "title": "Scholars from 3 nations to discuss Ahn Jung-geun's legacy, missing remains",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/education/20261126/scholars-from-3-nations-to-discuss-ahn-jung-geuns-legacy-missing-remains",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
