   "title": "SAMPADA data claims lower anaemia prevalence in India than previous surveys",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/sci-tech/health/sampada-data-claims-lower-anaemia-prevalence-in-india-than-previous-surveys/article71737352.ece",
